findings.claim:
The composition guard makes every existing test that reaches a native phase fail, not just all_presets. Examples:
- explicit_stricter_selection_and_unsupported_review_capability_are_honest expects StepResult::Failed and now gets Err;
- preparation_definitive_fail_and_both_invalidation_publication_conflicts_retain, changed=0, now refuses with AdapterUnavailable before reservation;
- the preparation_*, gate and recovery fixtures.

The committed evidence covers only the three focused controls and one legacy positive. There is no complete classified failure list, so an unexpected regression in a test that should still pass (EvidencePort-only, Store, adapter) could hide among the expected failures. The earlier adapter StateConflict-vs-SessionLost failure is also still unattributed.
